  "outlookText": "000\nACPN50 PHFO 241112\nTWOCP \n\nTropical Weather Outlook\nNWS Central Pacific Hurricane Center Honolulu HI\nIssued by NWS National Hurricane Center Miami FL\n200 AM HST Tue Nov 24 2026\n\nFor the central North Pacific...between 140W and 180W:\n\nWestern Central Pacific:\nDisorganized showers and thunderstorms located over a thousand miles\nsouthwest of the Hawaiian Islands are associated with an area of low\npressure.  Some development of this system is possible during the\nnext couple of days before upper-level winds become too strong by\nFriday.\n* Formation chance through 48 hours...low...10 percent.\n* Formation chance through 7 days...low...20 percent.\n\n$$\nForecaster Blake\nNNNN",
